+        "the paper's 3-SAT gadget; the reference algorithm recovers the XOR rows "
+        "and uses O(n^3) Gauss-Jordan elimination over GF(2), with shipping-preset "
+        "wall-clock and operation counts measured in selftest, whereas the hidden-"
+        "cycle recurrence needs at most 3n+4 exact operations."
+    ),
+    "max_answer_tokens": 143,
+}
+
+NATIVE = {
