The second vendor failed to produce a valid witness at `easy`; the level is currently 1/2 solved and one vendor remains. Regardless of that third result, `easy` will be escalated because one successful oracle is enough to defeat a rung.
diff --git a/gen_1503_06063.py b/gen_1503_06063.py
