+        "tree 4-spanner of diameter at most 5.",
+        "",
+        f"Give your final answer inside <answer></answer> tags, as a JSON list of exactly {n} integers, each 0 or 1.",
+        "Example format for four variables: <answer>[0,1,1,0]</answer>",
